    <values><field>LongDescription__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:string">Finds: blng__BillingRule__c records that no Product2 references.
Why it matters: Cleanup signal — orphan rules clutter the catalog and obscure which rules are actually live. Often the residue of product retirements that didn&apos;t clean up linked rules.
Suppress a finding: for rules intentionally pre-staged for a future product line.
Disable the detector: leave on for hygiene.</value></values>
